This repository contains experimental ASR-alignment code licensed under the
MIT License in LICENSE.

It operates on NVIDIA NemotronLabs VoiceChat and streaming ASR model materials.
Those weights are not included and remain subject to NVIDIA's OpenMDW License
Agreement, version 1.1, and the notices in their upstream repositories:

  https://huggingface.co/nvidia/NVIDIA-NemotronLabs-VoiceChat-11B
  https://huggingface.co/nvidia/nemotron-3.5-asr-streaming-0.6b
  https://huggingface.co/nvidia/nemotron-speech-streaming-en-0.6b

The runtime parity checks use sansamour/llama-voicechat.cpp, an MIT-licensed
fork of llama.cpp:

  https://github.com/sansamour/llama-voicechat.cpp

This is an independent, unfinished research project and is not an NVIDIA
release.
